id: pm-rust-zmqa
title: Enable the gated pm-github issue sync
description: "Add the pinned reusable issue-sync caller and verify the existing CI workflow_dispatch trigger. Related adoption task: pm-github-aiok. Rust-only package: no root package.json and no braces dependency work. Validate just release-check and the locked-oracle strict health check; never trigger sync or change repository settings."
