comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-15T07:38:15.834Z",codex-agent,Batch 3 uses the prescribed 2026.10.14 fallback because v2026.10.15 is not released. CI already has workflow_dispatch. The exact fallback workflow still assumes root npm dependencies and predates changelog regeneration and CI dispatch from pm-github PR 122; this Rust-only caller needs the later repin before operational use. No root package.json is added. No runtime code changed and no behavioural revert is applicable. Install and use the committed tests/oracle lockfile exactly as CI does.
  "2026-10-15T08:33:12.035Z",codex-agent,"Full isolated just release-check PASS: 318/318 regular tests and 318/318 instrumented tests across 17 suites each, zero failures and ignored cases. Coverage: lines 5647/5647, functions 522/522, regions 8631/8631, branches 1194/1194 (all 100% at unchanged floors). fmt, clippy -D warnings, private-item rustdoc, native identity audit, required published-oracle differentials and canonical changelog check passed. cargo audit exited 0 with its pre-existing allowed unmaintained unsafe-libyaml 0.2.11 warning RUSTSEC-2024-0449; no vulnerability findings were reported. Locked oracle 2026.10.14 was installed exactly as CI does. Isolated oracle health --check-only --require-merge-drivers --strict-exit passes with existing guidance, staleness and provenance advisories. No histories were rewritten."
